# Fabeaulous Feet

> Fabeaulous Feet makes a professional pedicure system for nail and foot care professionals: an electric pedicure file, a medical grade stainless steel tip, and disposable REMOVE and POLISH dermabrasion discs used once per client, plus the LED MagniVac dust extraction lamp. Designed in Canada by pedicure professionals. Run from Nuevo Vallarta, Nayarit, Mexico by William Gordon Johnson (product development) and Karina Martinez (business operations). Sold to professionals in Mexico, Canada and the United States, with distributors in Canada, the United States, Portugal and Mexico. Professional use only.

