## Key facts
- Discs: REMOVE (blue, coarse, heavy callus) then POLISH (gray, fine, whole foot). Single use, one of each per client.
- Tip: flat, rounded medical grade stainless steel; covers more area than barrel bits.
- Electric file: 12V, 9 speeds, dual LED lights, 3.5 m cord, drops to low speed under excess pressure, 12-month limited warranty.
- MagniVac Lamp: dust vacuum, washable filter, 30 LEDs, 3x and 8x magnifiers.
- Orders ship from Mexico by courier; buyer pays import duties. All sales final.
